m3utolocal searches M3U playlists by tvg-id or tvg-name and downloads
static VOD media (mp4, mkv, etc.), skipping live streams. The installed
command is m3utolocal. Features include resume via .part files,
multi-threaded downloads, retries, an interactive Textual TUI, cleanup
of stale partials, and downloads stored under an XDG data library
(or -o) instead of the current working directory.

WWW: https://github.com/marklapointe/m3utolocal
